          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doctor is read only. Repair shows its plan, and runs only after you confirm, with a backup before each change. Acknowledge silences one warning for this bench until its message changes; failures cannot be acknowledged."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Main window."
    },
